// Benefits of trait-based monoids:
// 1. Runtime verification of mathematical monoid laws
// 2. Type-safe implementations using concrete types
// 3. Works with current Phase 1 compiler
// 4. Enables building complex data structures (lists, trees, etc.)
// 5. Supports different monoid instances for same underlying type
// 6. Foundation for efficient parallel computations
